      "title": {
        "en": "Noticeable behavioral and obedience gains"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners celebrate significant progress in obedience, loose-leash walking, and distraction focus across the curriculum. Several clients with reactive rescue dogs credit specialized reactivity classes and clubs with transformative behavioral improvements. Reviewers also report rewarding achievements in agility courses, tricks, and nose work programs."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 35,
      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable and encouraging trainers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients express widespread admiration for the training team, regularly commending instructors such as Pamela, Sharon, Sue, and Rebekah. Reviewers highlight their positive reinforcement techniques, individual attention, and patient guidance during group classes and private sessions. Pet parents feel genuinely supported in understanding canine psychology and behavior."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Well-equipped canine fitness facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently praise the spacious, clean layout of the Damen Avenue center. Clients highlight the specialized agility rings, enrichment rooms, and retail boutique stocked with quality canine supplies. The facility is described as a stimulating, well-organized environment where dogs eagerly socialize, exercise, and practice new skills safely."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What training programs are offered at Urban Pooch?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients participate in puppy foundations, leveled obedience courses, agility training, nose work, and reactive dog clubs."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the center support reactive dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The facility offers specialized classes and ongoing clubs designed to help owners manage reactivity and navigate urban distractions."
      },
